{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37471","headline":"春雨 · 唐彦谦","name":"春雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绮陌夜来雨，春楼寒望迷。\n远客迎燕戏，乱响隔莺啼。\n有恨开兰室，无言对李蹊。\n花欹浑拂槛，柳重欲垂堤。\n灯檠昏鱼目，薰炉咽麝脐。\n别轻天北鹤，梦怯汝南鸡。\n入户侵罗幌，捎檐润绣题。\n新丰树已失，长信草初齐。\n乱蝶寒犹舞，惊乌暝不栖。\n庾郎盘马地，却怕有春泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}